1
00:00:04,500 --> 00:00:12,736
Session results lists every past session and match, with how many players gave feedback and whether you reviewed it.

2
00:00:12,736 --> 00:00:19,689
Filter by trainings, matches or sessions still waiting for your review.

3
00:00:19,689 --> 00:00:25,976
Open Wednesday’s training. Your RPE sits next to the players’ average and their distribution.

4
00:00:25,976 --> 00:00:32,269
Your review: perceived intensity, how the session went, its real duration and your notes.

5
00:00:32,269 --> 00:00:40,106
Then each player: present or not, a rating out of 10 and a short observation for the staff.

6
00:00:40,106 --> 00:00:46,786
Players’ own comments appear alongside, so you see how the session felt from the inside.

7
00:00:46,786 --> 00:00:55,015
For a match, the review is the match sheet: score, and every goal, card and substitution on a timeline.

8
00:00:55,015 --> 00:01:02,104
Team stats against the opponent, and playing time — which goes straight into each player’s load.

9
00:01:02,104 --> 00:01:09,568
Share a read-only match summary with families through a public link — and revoke it any time.
